{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ES33a6vnWkwCD7B1EdHiy6","type":"tool_result","content":"# agent-evals\n\nA small harness that runs coding agents on short tasks and keeps everything a\nrun produced, so the runs can be graded and compared later. It lives in\n`~/evals/agent-evals` on the eval Mac.\n\n`./run.sh <task> <lane> [rep]` copies `tasks/<task>/` into a scratch folder in\n`/tmp`, runs the lane's agent there with `tasks/<task>.prompt`, and writes the\nrun folder `runs/<task>-<lane>-r<rep>/`:\n\n- `prompt.txt`, `agent.log` (the agent's JSON event stream), `agent.err`,\n  `meta.json` (exit code, seconds);\n- `final.txt`, the agent's last message, for the Codex lanes;\n- `answer.json`, written by `check_answer.py`: the final answer the graders\n  read (from `final.txt` for Codex, from the event stream for Kimi).\n\nLanes:\n\n- `codex`: Codex CLI (`codex exec --json`), unsandboxed.\n- `kimi`: Kimi Code. Its output goes to Moonshot, so its shell runs under the\n  macOS sandbox profile `sandbox/agent.sb` (no reading or writing the real\n  home), with an empty scratch HOME. Kimi's own install and sessions live in\n  `~/.kimi-code`, which the profile opens.\n\nCodex logs in with an API key from the environment (`CODEX_API_KEY`), so it\nneeds nothing from the home folder.\n--- check_answer.py\n\"\"\"The final answer of a run, as the graders read it: final.txt (Codex lanes), else the last assistant message in\nthe Kimi stream-json log. usage: check_answer.py <run folder>  ->  {\"final\": \"...\", \"source\": \"...\"}\"\"\"\nimport json, os, sys\n\nR = sys.argv[1]\ndef read(p):\n    try: return open(p, errors=\"replace\").read()\n    except OSError: return \"\"\n\nfinal, source = read(os.path.join(R, \"final.txt\")), \"final.txt\"\nlane = json.loads(read(os.path.join(R, \"meta.json\")) or \"{}\").get(\"lane\", \"\")\nif not final.strip() and lane.startswith(\"kimi\"):\n    source = \"agent.log\"\n    for line in reversed(read(os.path.join(R, \"agent.log\")).splitlines()):\n        try: d = json.loads(line)\n        except ValueError: continue\n        if d.get(\"role\") == \"assistant\" and isinstance(d.get(\"content\"), str) and d[\"content\"].strip():\n            final = d[\"content\"]; break\nprint(json.dumps({\"final\": final, \"source\": source if final.strip() else \"none\"}))\n--- .gitignore\nruns/*\n!runs/.keep\n--- tasks\ntasks\nruns\ntasks/fizz.prompt\ntasks/fizz\nruns/.keep\ntasks/fizz/fizz.py\n--- tools\n/opt/homebrew/bin/codex\n/usr/bin/sandbox-exec\ntotal 193380\ndrwxr-xr-x  33 valentinakoniukhova staff      1056 Nov  9 23:53 .\ndrwxr-x--- 106 valentinakoniukhova staff      3392 Nov  9 23:53 ..\n-rw-r--r--   1 valentinakoniukhova staff         3 Feb  4  2026 .personality_migration\n-rw-------   1 valentinakoniukhova staff         3 Oct  3 09:46 .sandbox_migration\n-rw-r--r--   1 valentinakoniukhova staff         0 Oct  3 22:54 .sqlite-maintenance.lock\ndrwxr-xr-x   7 valentinakoniukhova staff       224 Nov  9 23:51 .tmp\n-rw-------   1 valentinakoniukhova staff      3877 Nov  4 20:11 auth.json\ndrwxr-xr-x   6 valentinakoniukhova staff       192 Oct  8 10:32 cache\n-rw-------   1 valentinakoniukhova staff    139848 Nov  9 23:51 config.toml\ntotal 185156\ndrwxr-xr-x  5 valentinakoniukhova staff       160 Nov  7 00:24 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 21 valentinakoniukhova staff       672 Nov  9 03:42 ..\n-rwxr-xr-x  1 valentinakoniukhova staff   2953808 Mar 10  2026 fd\n-rwxr-xr-x  1 valentinakoniukhova staff 182590912 Nov  6 23:51 kimi\nHOME=/Users/valentinakoniukhova\n4d6d0f2 base","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a90e5235-fa31-483f-afde-7d9b61e91d4f","uuid":"77d3b6ee-826e-40b9-a336-67fa23bcfa2d","timestamp":"2026-11-10T02:54:13.540Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# agent-evals\n\nA small harness that runs coding agents on short tasks and keeps everything a\nrun produced, so the runs can be graded and compared later. It lives in\n`~/evals/agent-evals` on the eval Mac.\n\n`./run.sh <task> <lane> [rep]` copies `tasks/<task>/` into a scratch folder in\n`/tmp`, runs the lane's agent there with `tasks/<task>.prompt`, and writes the\nrun folder `runs/<task>-<lane>-r<rep>/`:\n\n- `prompt.txt`, `agent.log` (the agent's JSON event stream), `agent.err`,\n  `meta.json` (exit code, seconds);\n- `final.txt`, the agent's last message, for the Codex lanes;\n- `answer.json`, written by `check_answer.py`: the final answer the graders\n  read (from `final.txt` for Codex, from the event stream for Kimi).\n\nLanes:\n\n- `codex`: Codex CLI (`codex exec --json`), unsandboxed.\n- `kimi`: Kimi Code. Its output goes to Moonshot, so its shell runs under the\n  macOS sandbox profile `sandbox/agent.sb` (no reading or writing the real\n  home), with an empty scratch HOME. Kimi's own install and sessions live in\n  `~/.kimi-code`, which the profile opens.\n\nCodex logs in with an API key from the environment (`CODEX_API_KEY`), so it\nneeds nothing from the home folder.\n--- check_answer.py\n\"\"\"The final answer of a run, as the graders read it: final.txt (Codex lanes), else the last assistant message in\nthe Kimi stream-json log. usage: check_answer.py <run folder>  ->  {\"final\": \"...\", \"source\": \"...\"}\"\"\"\nimport json, os, sys\n\nR = sys.argv[1]\ndef read(p):\n    try: return open(p, errors=\"replace\").read()\n    except OSError: return \"\"\n\nfinal, source = read(os.path.join(R, \"final.txt\")), \"final.txt\"\nlane = json.loads(read(os.path.join(R, \"meta.json\")) or \"{}\").get(\"lane\", \"\")\nif not final.strip() and lane.startswith(\"kimi\"):\n    source = \"agent.log\"\n    for line in reversed(read(os.path.join(R, \"agent.log\")).splitlines()):\n        try: d = json.loads(line)\n        except ValueError: continue\n        if d.get(\"role\") == \"assistant\" and isinstance(d.get(\"content\"), str) and d[\"content\"].strip():\n            final = d[\"content\"]; break\nprint(json.dumps({\"final\": final, \"source\": source if final.strip() else \"none\"}))\n--- .gitignore\nruns/*\n!runs/.keep\n--- tasks\ntasks\nruns\ntasks/fizz.prompt\ntasks/fizz\nruns/.keep\ntasks/fizz/fizz.py\n--- tools\n/opt/homebrew/bin/codex\n/usr/bin/sandbox-exec\ntotal 193380\ndrwxr-xr-x  33 valentinakoniukhova staff      1056 Nov  9 23:53 .\ndrwxr-x--- 106 valentinakoniukhova staff      3392 Nov  9 23:53 ..\n-rw-r--r--   1 valentinakoniukhova staff         3 Feb  4  2026 .personality_migration\n-rw-------   1 valentinakoniukhova staff         3 Oct  3 09:46 .sandbox_migration\n-rw-r--r--   1 valentinakoniukhova staff         0 Oct  3 22:54 .sqlite-maintenance.lock\ndrwxr-xr-x   7 valentinakoniukhova staff       224 Nov  9 23:51 .tmp\n-rw-------   1 valentinakoniukhova staff      3877 Nov  4 20:11 auth.json\ndrwxr-xr-x   6 valentinakoniukhova staff       192 Oct  8 10:32 cache\n-rw-------   1 valentinakoniukhova staff    139848 Nov  9 23:51 config.toml\ntotal 185156\ndrwxr-xr-x  5 valentinakoniukhova staff       160 Nov  7 00:24 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 21 valentinakoniukhova staff       672 Nov  9 03:42 ..\n-rwxr-xr-x  1 valentinakoniukhova staff   2953808 Mar 10  2026 fd\n-rwxr-xr-x  1 valentinakoniukhova staff 182590912 Nov  6 23:51 kimi\nHOME=/Users/valentinakoniukhova\n4d6d0f2 base","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01ES33a6vnWkwCD7B1EdHiy6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
