warning: a write was denied, see $R/agent.err\" >&2; fi\n  return $rc\n}\n\nstart=$(date +%s)\ncase $A in\n  codex) codex_run;;\n  codex-sandboxed) codexsb_run;;\n  kimi)  kimi_run;;"}}}
